208: 
209: **Tests:**
210: 
211: - Single cursor: middle/start/end of word
212: - Single cursor: on whitespace (no change)
213: - Multi-cursor: different words → both selected
214: - Multi-cursor: same word → merged to one cursor/selection
215: - Unicode words (café, emoji)
